    [5257]={name="Dark Hooded Cape",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Nimar the Slayer (rare spawn) in Eastern Kingdoms.",zone="Eastern Kingdoms",npc="Nimar the Slayer"},
    [5274]={name="Rose Mantle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Morganth”. In Redridge Mountains.",zone="Redridge Mountains",questName="Morganth",lore="After much observation, I have discovered Morganth's plans. He searches for the Scythe of Elune...and he may have found it! If he has, then the Redridge Mountains, and the kingdom of Stormwind, will soon feel his dark might."},
    [5275]={name="Binding Girdle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Disruption Ends” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Disruption Ends",lore="One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout."},
    [5310]={name="Sea Dog Britches",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Guns of Northwatch” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Guns of Northwatch",lore="Yet another ship from my fleet has been lost to those overzealous humans at Northwatch Hold! Those bastards must be dealt with. Their paranoia has them in a state of frenzy."},
    [5311]={name="Buckled Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Free From the Hold” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Free From the Hold",lore="Finally! Someone to rescue me! I can't believe you got past the guards. These zealots from Theramore are out of their minds. They sank our ship and imprisoned me, the only survivor."},
    [5314]={name="Boar Hunter's Cape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Consumed by Hatred” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Consumed by Hatred",lore="Perhaps you know the pain of uncertainty, perhaps not. But know this: I stand here every day, from the sun's rising till its decline, scouring the horizon for more of those monsters."},
    [5319]={name="Bashing Pauldrons",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Haren Swifthoof (rare elite) in The Loch.",zone="The Loch",npc="Haren Swifthoof"},
    [5324]={name="Engineer's Hammer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Samophlange” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Samophlange",lore="Pulling open the face of the control console reveals a dense jumble of wires, tubing and other strange mechanical objects--most of which seem to serve no practical purpose."},
    [5325]={name="Welding Shield",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Samophlange” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Samophlange",lore="Pulling open the face of the control console reveals a dense jumble of wires, tubing and other strange mechanical objects--most of which seem to serve no practical purpose."},
    [5327]={name="Greasy Tinker's Pants",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Escape” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Escape",lore="I suppose I'll learn as we go... Couldn't be too hard. Just some buttons here, and a lever or two... Well, are you ready to go?"},
    [5340]={name="Cauldron Stirrer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Apothecary Zamah”. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Apothecary Zamah",lore="I have rendered the spores you gave me into an emulsion. I must now send it to my associate, Apothecary Zamah. If you were to carry this to her, she can offer you something from our stores of alchemical goods."},
    [5341]={name="Spore-covered Tunic",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Root Samples”.",questName="Root Samples",lore="The herbs of the Barrens are not quite like herbs in other lands. Their properties are mostly the same, but the oasis water here alters the plants; they are just slightly different."},
    [5345]={name="Stonewood Hammer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Centaur Bracers” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5351]={name="Bounty Hunter's Ring",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Hezrul Bloodmark”. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Hezrul Bloodmark",lore="Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."},
    [5357]={name="Ward of the Vale",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Isha Awak” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Isha Awak",lore="The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."},
    [5394]={name="Archery Training Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Balance of Nature” — pick it over the other choices. In Shadowglen.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Greetings. I am Conservator Ilthalaine. My purpose in Shadowglen is to ensure that the balance of nature is maintained."},
    [5395]={name="Woodland Shield",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Webwood Egg” — pick it over the other choices. In Shadowglen.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="Webwood Egg",lore="Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study. Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young."},
    [5404]={name="Serpent's Shoulders",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lady Anacondra in Wailing Caverns.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Lady Anacondra"},
    [5423]={name="Boahn's Fang",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Boahn (rare spawn) in Wailing Caverns.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Boahn"},
    [5443]={name="Gold-plated Buckler",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Miner Johnson in The Deadmines.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Miner Johnson"},
    [5542]={name="Pearl-clasped Cloak",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5581]={name="Smooth Walking Staff",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Stolen Journal” — pick it over the other choices. In Coldridge Valley.",zone="Coldridge Valley",questName="The Stolen Journal",lore="My journal! They took it away to the cave. The one that had it... It was a big brute with some odd markings on his skin and face. I didn't get a much better look than that."},
    [5591]={name="Rain-spotted Cape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Enchanted Glade” — pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5595]={name="Thicket Hammer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Crown of the Earth” — pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Crown of the Earth",lore="Without the blessings of Alexstrasza the Life-Binder and Nozdormu the Timeless, Teldrassil's growth has not been without flaw."},
    [5611]={name="Tear of Grief",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “For Love Eternal”. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="For Love Eternal",lore="In the aftermath of the battles at the Well of Eternity, I heard that Ameth'Aran had been destroyed, its people dead, including my love, Anaya."},
    [5617]={name="Vagabond Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Bashal'Aran” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5627]={name="Relic Blade",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Absent Minded Prospector” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil. While I traveled on the road to meet Whelgar, I was attacked by raptors and the relic was lost."},
    [5629]={name="Hammerfist Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Absent Minded Prospector” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
    [5630]={name="Windfelt Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Absent Minded Prospector” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
    [5753]={name="Ruffled Chaplet",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Terrowulf Packlord (rare spawn) in Kalimdor.",zone="Kalimdor",npc="Terrowulf Packlord"},
    [5754]={name="Wolfpack Medallion",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Terrowulf Packlord (rare spawn) in Kalimdor.",zone="Kalimdor",npc="Terrowulf Packlord"},
    [5756]={name="Sliverblade",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 38 creature types around level 29-40. Also found on the auction house.",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts a target for 45 Frost damage."},
    [5761]={name="Anvilmar Sledge",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Troll Cave” — pick it over the other choices. In Coldridge Valley.",zone="Coldridge Valley",questName="The Troll Cave",lore="My brother Senir and I were sent to different parts of Dun Morogh to investigate the threat posed by the trolls. The Senate has its hands full with the troggs, so they've no need for further annoyances."},
    [5776]={name="Elder's Cane",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Rite of Strength” — pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Rite of Strength",lore="The Rites of the Earthmother are the steps a young tauren needs to take to gain respect in Thunder Bluff. First you must pass the Rite of Strength."},
    [5777]={name="Brave's Axe",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Rite of Strength” — pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Rite of Strength",lore="The Rites of the Earthmother are the steps a young tauren needs to take to gain respect in Thunder Bluff. First you must pass the Rite of Strength."},
    [5778]={name="Primitive Walking Stick",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Vile Familiars” — pick it over the other choices.",questName="Vile Familiars",lore="I trust the Valley of Trials will teach you much, young. I was sent to the Valley to guide you, but I have discovered a growing taint here..."},
    [5780]={name="Murloc Scale Belt",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5781]={name="Murloc Scale Breastplate",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5782]={name="Thick Murloc Armor",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5936]={name="Animal Skin Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Gathering Leather” — pick it over the other choices. In Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Gathering Leather",lore="Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"},
    [5957]={name="Handstitched Leather Vest",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [5958]={name="Fine Leather Pants",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
