    [9533]={name="Masons Fraternity Ring",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Divino-matic Rod” — pick it over the other choices. In Zul'Farrak.",zone="Zul'Farrak",questName="Divino-matic Rod",lore="Sergeant Bly stole from me! He said he'd only borrow it, but he stole my cherished divino-matic rod!! Without that rod how will I know where to dig new water holes??"},
    [9601]={name="Cushioned Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Sathrah's Sacrifice” — pick it over the other choices. In Darnassus.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Sathrah's Sacrifice",lore="Now you must finish the task to which you have been appointed. Take the spinnerets and offer Lady Sathrah's sacrifice to Elune; lay the great spider to rest."},
    [9603]={name="Gritroot Staff",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Relics of Wakening” — pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Relics of Wakening",lore="Gnarlpine invaders were seen ravaging the Ban'ethil Barrow Den to the west. The slumbering druids will be trapped in the Emerald Dream for eternity, unaware of their fate, unless we help."},
    [9609]={name="Shilly Mitts",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators” — pick it over the other choices. In Gnomeregan.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators",lore="It's terrible. We are not going to have enough parts to get our fleet of gyrodrillmatic excavationators to Dun Morogh. What we need are spare parts."},
    [9624]={name="Triprunner Dungarees",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Rig Wars” — pick it over the other choices. In Gnomeregan.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Rig Wars",lore="Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined."},
    [9631]={name="Pratt's Handcrafted Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Mark of Quality” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!"},
    [9632]={name="Jangdor's Handcrafted Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Mark of Quality” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!"},
    [9636]={name="Swashbuckler Sash",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Deliver to MacKinley” — pick it over the other choices. In Tanaris.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Deliver to MacKinley",lore="Thanks again for your help. Here's a bottle of Steamwheedle bilge rum. Take it to MacKinley and he can finally put to rest his crazy beliefs about Booty Bay booze."},
    [9641]={name="Lifeblood Amulet",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Antu'sul in Zul'Farrak.",zone="Zul'Farrak",npc="Antu'sul"},
    [9647]={name="Failed Flying Experiment",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Rescue OOX-22/FE!” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Rescue OOX-22/FE!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-22/FE to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9650]={name="Honorguard Chestpiece",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Venom to the Undercity” — pick it over the other choices. In The Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Venom to the Undercity",lore="The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff."},
    [9651]={name="Gryphon Rider's Stormhammer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Saving Sharpbeak” — pick it over the other choices. In The Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Saving Sharpbeak",lore="We must save Sharpbeak! Fight your way to the top of Jintha'Alor in the heart of Vilebranch territory, gain the key to Sharpbeak's cage from the vile Priestess Hexx, and then find and save Sharpbeak!",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts a target for 91 to 125 Nature damage."},
    [9652]={name="Gryphon Rider's Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Saving Sharpbeak” — pick it over the other choices. In The Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Saving Sharpbeak",lore="We must save Sharpbeak! Fight your way to the top of Jintha'Alor in the heart of Vilebranch territory, gain the key to Sharpbeak's cage from the vile Priestess Hexx, and then find and save Sharpbeak!"},
    [9658]={name="Boots of the Maharishi",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Gordunni Cobalt” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Gordunni Cobalt",lore="I just arrived here in Feralas, and I've heard that the Gordunni Ogres that inhabit the wilds here have some interesting minerals. Who knows what they are up to, but they sure are protective of that stuff!"},
    [9663]={name="Dawnrider's Chestpiece",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Delivering the Relic” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Delivering the Relic",lore="If you would be so kind as to deliver the relic to my wife Vestia, I would appreciate it. She's not only a fine priestess for our community, but she is one of the most well-versed scholars you'll find anywhere."},
